      "refersTo": "signal-chip",
      "description": "统一的状态标签：图标加文字，分正常、蓝、黄、橙、红五级。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-signal ds-signal-yellow\">⚠ 数据暂未更新，请检查连接</span>",
      "css": ".ds-signal{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:24px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #f1dc9b;background:#fff7e0;color:#8a5a00;font:500 12px system-ui}"
    },
    {
      "name": "侧栏交易对",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "sidebar-pair",
      "description": "深色侧栏中的交易对行：状态点、等宽交易对、方向箭头；当前项使用选中底色。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-pair\"><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span><span>BTCUSDC</span><span>↑</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-pair{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:34px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#1b2f55;color:#e6edf7;font:500 13px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}.ds-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#3fcf96}"
    },
    {
      "name": "主按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "信号蓝填充，8px 圆角，36px 高；深色主题使用深色文字以保证对比度。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn\">保存并立即生效</button>",
